{"unit_id":"meimiaoji-creator__meow-dsh-workflow#card-zh","repo":"meimiaoji-creator/meow-dsh-workflow","commit":"b34a3552854f8cce4a9d1fd96309a1fde351e69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"meow-dsh-workflow 是面向 DSH web profile 的角色工作流插件。它在会话界面提供角色面板与斜杠命令，并通过 Web 路由组装角色提示词、维护 Agent 定义。主要功能包括按角色发起会话、创建或续聊带 persona 与工具白名单的子 agent、读写角色记忆和项目台账。适合需要按职责组织多个 agent、复用角色配置并跨会话记录项目决策的 DSH 用户。插件不要求额外 API 密钥，数据保存在 DSH 数据目录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-86","cordis.patch.yml:7-14"]}
{"unit_id":"meimiaoji-creator__meow-dsh-workflow#card-en","repo":"meimiaoji-creator/meow-dsh-workflow","commit":"b34a3552854f8cce4a9d1fd96309a1fde351e69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"meow-dsh-workflow adds role workflows to DSH web. Users can start role based sessions from a panel or slash command, delegate to persona scoped subagents, and continue runs by ID. It also stores project scoped role memory and ledgers. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-86","cordis.patch.yml:7-14"]}
